{
  "info": {
    "name": "paccradle API: dev seed sign-ins (2026-10-30)",
    "description": "M1-D9 (2026-10-30). **Not a contract change**: no request or response changes, and the contract versions stay as they are. Sign-ins for the seeded development accounts (`scripts/dev-seed.sh`, `examples/dev_seed.rs`); use them with the environment `dev-seed-2026-10-30.postman_environment.json`.\n\n| Name | Email | Has |\n|---|---|---|\n| Ada Admin | admin@paccradle.test | the admin role |\n| Bima Buyer | buyer@paccradle.test | free plan, no credits, 3 designs (exports answer 402) |\n| Citra Credits | credits@paccradle.test | 4 credits left, her cradle unlocked |\n| Dewi Pro | pro@paccradle.test | Pro monthly, active |\n\nPassword for every one: `paccradle-dev-pass` (`{{seed_password}}`). Run `scripts/dev-seed.sh` again to put them back as seeded.\n\n**Back office**: admins sign in with a passkey only, which Postman can't make. Run `scripts/dev-seed.sh admin-token`, paste the cookie value (after `paccradle_admin_refresh=`) into `admin_refresh_token`, then send *Back office: refresh*: it saves `admin_access_token` (5 minutes) and the next cookie. Send it again whenever the token runs out; the session ends 12 hours after `admin-token` signed in.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Web app accounts (password sign-in)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sign in as Ada Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('signed in', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.environment.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
                  "const cookie = pm.cookies.get('paccradle_refresh');",
                  "if (cookie) pm.environment.set('refresh_token', cookie);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/client/v1/auth/password/sign-in",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "client",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "password",
                "sign-in"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Ada Admin: the admin role. On the web app she is an ordinary account; the back office needs her passkey (below).\n\nSaves `access_token` and `refresh_token` in the environment, so every other collection's requests run as this account. The access token lasts 15 minutes: send this again, or the auth collection's Refresh.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{admin_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{seed_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sign in as Bima Buyer",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('signed in', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.environment.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
                  "const cookie = pm.cookies.get('paccradle_refresh');",
                  "if (cookie) pm.environment.set('refresh_token', cookie);",
                  "pm.environment.set('design_id', pm.environment.get('bima_cradle_id'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/client/v1/auth/password/sign-in",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "client",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "password",
                "sign-in"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Bima Buyer: free plan, no credits, 3 designs (cradle, card, grid). SVG, PDF or DXF of any of them answers 402 `EXPORT_PAYMENT_REQUIRED` with the checkout; PNG and the test print are free.\n\nSaves `access_token` and `refresh_token` in the environment, and `design_id` (`{{bima_cradle_id}}`), so every other collection's requests run as this account. The access token lasts 15 minutes: send this again, or the auth collection's Refresh.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{buyer_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{seed_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sign in as Citra Credits",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('signed in', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.environment.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
                  "const cookie = pm.cookies.get('paccradle_refresh');",
                  "if (cookie) pm.environment.set('refresh_token', cookie);",
                  "pm.environment.set('design_id', pm.environment.get('citra_cradle_id'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/client/v1/auth/password/sign-in",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "client",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "password",
                "sign-in"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Citra Credits: bought a 5-pack and spent 1 on her cradle (unlocked for 30 days, its export done once the API's worker ran it): 4 credits left. Her card isn't unlocked: exporting it spends a credit.\n\nSaves `access_token` and `refresh_token` in the environment, and `design_id` (`{{citra_cradle_id}}`), so every other collection's requests run as this account. The access token lasts 15 minutes: send this again, or the auth collection's Refresh.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{credits_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{seed_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sign in as Dewi Pro",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('signed in', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.environment.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
                  "const cookie = pm.cookies.get('paccradle_refresh');",
                  "if (cookie) pm.environment.set('refresh_token', cookie);",
                  "pm.environment.set('design_id', pm.environment.get('dewi_grid_id'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/client/v1/auth/password/sign-in",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "client",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "password",
                "sign-in"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Dewi Pro: Pro monthly, active for 30 days from seeding. Exports unlock her designs without spending credits.\n\nSaves `access_token` and `refresh_token` in the environment, and `design_id` (`{{dewi_grid_id}}`), so every other collection's requests run as this account. The access token lasts 15 minutes: send this again, or the auth collection's Refresh.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{pro_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{seed_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Back office (seeded passkey)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Back office: refresh",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('refreshed', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.environment.set('admin_access_token', pm.response.json().access_token);",
                  "const cookie = pm.cookies.get('paccradle_admin_refresh');",
                  "if (cookie) pm.environment.set('admin_refresh_token', cookie);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Cookie",
                "value": "paccradle_admin_refresh={{admin_refresh_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/v1/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "admin",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Trades `admin_refresh_token` (from `scripts/dev-seed.sh admin-token`) for a 5-minute `admin_access_token`, and saves the next cookie: each refresh replaces it, and sending a replaced one again ends the session. No `Origin` header, so it works whether or not `ADMIN_WEB_URL` is set."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Back office: me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_access_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/v1/me",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "admin",
                "v1",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Ada's back-office account: `role` is `admin`."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
